msgid "semantic type as recorded"
msgstr "type sémantique tel que consigné"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/semanticTypeAsRecorded|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The provider's original semantic-type code for which no WorldObjectKind was supplied. Keep the code unchanged rather than inventing a kind or identity."
msgstr "Le code de type sémantique original du fournisseur pour lequel aucun WorldObjectKind n’a été fourni. Conserver le code sans inventer un type ou une identité."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/semanticTypeAsRecorded|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
