msgid "The recorded instant of the acceptance act, distinct from a document's dateAccepted and from the source record's transaction time."
msgstr "L’instant consigné de l’acte d’acceptation, distinct de dateAccepted d’un document et du temps de transaction de l’enregistrement source."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptedAt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
